  "description": "Implement the complete approved Story-Aware Dynamic Validation plan from 2026-08-18. This successor replaces documentation-only zombie B-38b7 and delivers DYN-1 through DYN-5. It is not a changed-path test filter: every command begins unverified, the complete current inventory remains the denominator, and dynamic PASS requires executed plus reused equal inventory with zero unverified, uncovered, or unmapped rows. Reuse needs a current certified source closure and admissible signed per-command PASS receipt. Preserve source-first Wave 0 build proof, dual-revision dependencies, deterministic additive selection, full escalation under uncertainty, full validation as fallback/audit oracle, focused receipt separation, and independent DONE-required evidence.",
